    },
    {
      "text": "(38:83) \u0625\u0650\u0644\u0651\u064e\u0627 \u0639\u0650\u0628\u064e\u0627\u062f\u064e\u0643\u064e \u0645\u0650\u0646\u0652\u0647\u064f\u0645\u064f \u0671\u0644\u0652\u0645\u064f\u062e\u0652\u0644\u064e\u0635\u0650\u064a\u0646\u064e",
      "start": 252.761,
      "end": 254.761,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": "(38:83)",
          "start": 252.761,
          "end": 253.161,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "\u0625\u0650\u0644\u0651\u064e\u0627",
          "start": 253.161,
          "end": 253.561,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "\u0639\u0650\u0628\u064e\u0627\u062f\u064e\u0643\u064e",
          "start": 253.561,
          "end": 253.961,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "\u0645\u0650\u0646\u0652\u0647\u064f\u0645\u064f",
          "start": 253.961,
          "end": 254.361,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "\u0671\u0644\u0652\u0645\u064f\u062e\u0652\u0644\u064e\u0635\u0650\u064a\u0646\u064e",
          "start": 254.361,
          "end": 254.761,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Iblis swore that he will come from in front of us, from behind us, from our right and our left.",
      "start": 256.169,
      "end": 261.327,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
