          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "God.",
          "start": 322.271,
          "end": 322.637,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Satan came to them from their right, from their left, from their front, from their back.",
