          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "\u0671\u0644\u0644\u0651\u064e\u0647\u0650",
          "start": 363.038,
          "end": 363.5,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "They set up their rabbis and their priests as gods beside God.",
