          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "\u062f\u064f\u0648\u0646\u0650",
          "start": 400.363,
          "end": 400.748,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "\u0671\u0644\u0644\u0651\u064e\u0647\u0650",
          "start": 400.748,
          "end": 401.134,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "They, they set up their religious scholars as gods besides God.",
