          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "God.",
          "start": 406.506,
          "end": 407.005,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And they take the words of God, the Torah.",
