          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "that.",
          "start": 423.932,
          "end": 424.208,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And of course, they are wrong.",
      "start": 424.444,
      "end": 425.642,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
