          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "\u064a\u064f\u0624\u0652\u0645\u0650\u0646\u064f\u0648\u0646\u064e",
          "start": 803.183,
          "end": 803.643,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "\u0628\u0650\u0671\u0644\u0652\u0640\u0654\u064e\u0627\u062e\u0650\u0631\u064e\u0629\u0650",
          "start": 803.643,
          "end": 804.104,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "You have to ask yourself \"If someone is talking to me about God alone, without Jesus, Mary, Muhammad, Sayyid Al-Badaw\u012b or anyone, am I going to get upset? Am I going to kill this person?\"",
      "start": 804.104,
      "end": 814.824,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": "You",
          "start": 804.104,
          "end": 804.41,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "have",
          "start": 804.41,
          "end": 804.717,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "to",
          "start": 804.717,
