          "start": 942.224,
          "end": 942.624,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "\u062a\u064f\u0624\u0652\u0645\u0650\u0646\u064f\u0648\u0627\u06df",
          "start": 942.624,
          "end": 943.024,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And when you add some other names to Him, you believe.",
