          "start": 948.018,
          "end": 948.418,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "\u0671\u0644\u0652\u0643\u064e\u0628\u0650\u064a\u0631\u0650",
          "start": 948.418,
          "end": 948.818,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So, this is the other, this is the number one criterion.",
