          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "wall.",
          "start": 1008.917,
          "end": 1009.332,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When you read the Quran, we put between you and those who do not believe in the Hereafter, an invisible wall.",
