          "end": 1188.869,
          "speaker": "A man"
        },
        {
          "word": "Quran.",
          "start": 1188.869,
          "end": 1189.104,
          "speaker": "A man"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Now, some people try to tell me that I don't know the grammar of the Quran because",
      "start": 1190.19,
      "end": 1195.95,
      "speaker": "A man",
      "words": [
        {
