          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "of",
          "start": 1435.603,
          "end": 1435.822,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "Judgement,",
          "start": 1435.822,
          "end": 1436.04,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When the, when the sky breaks apart and the angels are sent down,",
