          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "say.",
          "start": 1683.385,
          "end": 1683.783,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "But they are not even aware. They don't know.",
      "start": 1683.783,
      "end": 1686.302,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
