          "end": 1686.022,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "know.",
          "start": 1686.022,
          "end": 1686.302,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So, these fabrications, Allah Subhanahu Wa Ta'ala wills that they exist in the world, in order to tell us whether I am a real believer or a false believer.",
