          "end": 2131.211,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "universe.",
          "start": 2131.211,
          "end": 2131.459,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And if he got the honorable message, If the honorable messenger uttered any other word, he would be fired as a prophet.",
