        },
        {
          "word": "22.",
          "start": 2299.6,
          "end": 2300.0,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So, what did Ibrahim contribute being the father of Islam?",
      "start": 2300.235,
      "end": 2303.28,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": "So,",
          "start": 2300.235,
          "end": 2300.54,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "what",
          "start": 2300.54,
          "end": 2300.844,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "did",
          "start": 2300.844,
          "end": 2301.149,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "Ibrahim",
          "start": 2301.149,
          "end": 2301.453,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "contribute",
          "start": 2301.453,
          "end": 2301.758,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "being",
          "start": 2301.758,
          "end": 2302.062,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "the",
          "start": 2302.062,
          "end": 2302.367,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "father",
          "start": 2302.367,
          "end": 2302.671,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "of",
          "start": 2302.671,
          "end": 2302.976,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "Islam?",
          "start": 2302.976,
          "end": 2303.28,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "We find out by studying Quran carefully that he contributed all religious practices of Islam.",
      "start": 2303.799,
      "end": 2310.267,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": "We",
          "start": 2303.799,
          "end": 2304.23,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "find",
          "start": 2304.23,
          "end": 2304.661,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "out",
          "start": 2304.661,
          "end": 2305.093,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "by",
          "start": 2305.093,
          "end": 2305.524,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "studying",
          "start": 2305.524,
          "end": 2305.955,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "Quran",
          "start": 2305.955,
          "end": 2306.386,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "carefully",
          "start": 2306.386,
          "end": 2306.817,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "that",
          "start": 2306.817,
          "end": 2307.249,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "he",
          "start": 2307.249,
          "end": 2307.68,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "contributed",
          "start": 2307.68,
          "end": 2308.111,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "all",
          "start": 2308.111,
          "end": 2308.542,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "religious",
          "start": 2308.542,
          "end": 2308.973,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "practices",
          "start": 2308.973,
          "end": 2309.405,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "of",
          "start": 2309.405,
          "end": 2309.836,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "Islam.",
          "start": 2309.836,
          "end": 2310.267,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The prophet Muhammad contributed the Quran.",
      "start": 2310.267,
      "end": 2313.848,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": "The",
          "start": 2310.267,
          "end": 2310.864,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "prophet",
          "start": 2310.864,
          "end": 2311.461,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "Muhammad",
          "start": 2311.461,
          "end": 2312.058,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "contributed",
          "start": 2312.058,
          "end": 2312.654,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "the",
          "start": 2312.654,
          "end": 2313.251,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "Quran.",
          "start": 2313.251,
          "end": 2313.848,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The Quran came through Muhammad's mouth, and that was his contribution.",
      "start": 2314.094,
      "end": 2317.573,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": "The",
          "start": 2314.094,
          "end": 2314.41,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "Quran",
          "start": 2314.41,
          "end": 2314.727,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "came",
          "start": 2314.727,
          "end": 2315.043,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "through",
          "start": 2315.043,
          "end": 2315.359,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "Muhammad's",
          "start": 2315.359,
          "end": 2315.675,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "mouth,",
          "start": 2315.675,
          "end": 2315.992,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "and",
          "start": 2315.992,
          "end": 2316.308,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "that",
          "start": 2316.308,
          "end": 2316.624,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "was",
          "start": 2316.624,
          "end": 2316.94,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "his",
          "start": 2316.94,
          "end": 2317.257,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "contribution.",
          "start": 2317.257,
          "end": 2317.573,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And this is also why at the beginning of Sura Al-Baqarah, number 2, we find that we must believe in what was revealed before the Quran.",
