          "end": 2415.23,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "To say \"you shall not befriend Christians and Jews, and that the Quran says so\" would be like saying \"you shall not Pray, because the Quran says you shall not pray.\"",
