        },
        {
          "word": "Haram.",
          "start": 2680.127,
          "end": 2680.364,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "What is Haram, consistently in Quran, is the taking of Riba, not the paying of Riba.",
